title: Authorizations › New case › Workflow › Prepare versus send, and sites
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Review & submit)
intro: A workflow can contain steps that prepare a payer-facing action (a portal packet, a fax packet, a call script) and steps that would transmit one. New case never runs a payer-facing step on its own. It prepares, and the one send is the existing 'Sign and send to payer (demo)', which a clinician must sign and which only simulates the send. The history says which steps prepared and that nothing was transmitted. Workflows and their traces are clinic-wide; the case, its history and the people who can open it stay at the case's site.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "The workflow has steps that prepare a portal, fax or phone action"
process p1 "The agents prepare the packet in Authorization preparation\nNothing is transmitted"
screen sc1 "Review & submit\nThe packet, the checks, 'What is missing'\nCard 'Sign' with 'Demo: simulated send. Nothing leaves the app.'"
decision d1 "Is a clinician signing, with the attestation, nothing blocking and any warning acknowledged?"
endx e1 "'Sign and send to payer (demo)' stays switched off"
click c1 "Click 'Sign and send to payer (demo)' and confirm"
store st1 "The request is recorded as Received (demo simulation)"
store st2 "History: 'Workflow approval recorded: Dr. Rivera (clinician)'\n'Prepared for Summit (demo simulation). Nothing was transmitted outside this app'\nDetail: what the workflow prepared, and that its portal, fax and email steps are not transmitted on their own"
decision d2 "Who is looking?"
screen sc2 "Jordan Perez or Alex Morgan\nBoth sites; the case is at its own site"
screen sc3 "Dr. Rivera (Site A only)\nOnly Site A cases and their workflow lines\nThe same clinic-wide workflows as everyone"
screen sc4 "Sam Okafor (Site B only)\nOnly Site B cases\nA Site A case link shows the out-of-site card, with no patient"
end e2 "The send stays a person's, simulated, and recorded"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Review & submit › Sign and send to payer"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Sites and scope"

s1 --> p1 --> sc1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| e1
d1 -->|Yes| c1 --> st1 --> st2 --> e2
st2 -.-> g1
sc1 --> d2
d2 -->|Both sites| sc2 --> e2
d2 -->|Site A only| sc3 --> e2
d2 -->|Site B only| sc4 --> e2
sc4 -.-> g2
